  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and ginger, and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, and salt, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add 2 cups of water and bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and cook for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Prepare the couscous according to package instructions.",
    "Serve the lamb and sauce over the fluffy couscous."
